{"3606950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Evolve Monsters Infinite", "steam_appid": 3606950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create. Hatch. Battle. Evolve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Monster Infinite</strong> is a <strong>turn-based roguelike monster battler</strong> where your imagination is the ultimate weapon! Draw your own creatures and let powerful AI bring them to life—then hatch them into monsters with unique stats, skills, and traits based on your artistic style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're sketching a fearsome beast or a cute little blob, <strong>every line matters</strong>. Each drawing becomes a one-of-a-kind monster that reflects your creativity—and evolves alongside your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Draw to Create, Hatch to Battle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game tools to <strong>draw your own monster designs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI transforms your drawing into a <strong>fully animated monster</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your drawing directly influences <strong>attributes, typing, and skills</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch your monster from an egg and start your evolutionary journey</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Strategic Turn-Based Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a <strong>custom team</strong> of monsters to explore rogue-style maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master turn-based battles with <strong>synergy-driven skills</strong> and counters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat other teams, earn resources, and <strong>mutate your monsters</strong> for the next run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a chance to learn, adapt, and get stronger</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌐 Train, Trade, and Compete</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade monsters and eggs</strong> with other players in an open marketplace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare traits, exclusive skills, and secret evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the global leaderboard to prove you're the <strong>#1 monster trainer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join seasonal events, tournaments, and <strong>community challenges</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 Infinite Evolution Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two monsters are ever the same. Your choices, your drawings, your battles—everything you do reshapes your team. Become the ultimate trainer in a world where <strong>art meets AI</strong>, and strategy meets infinite possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to turn your imagination into unstoppable monsters?</strong><br>Hatch your first creation in <strong>Evolve Monster Infinite</strong>—and evolve your legacy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create. Hatch. Battle. Evolve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Monster Infinite</strong> is a <strong>turn-based roguelike monster battler</strong> where your imagination is the ultimate weapon! Draw your own creatures and let powerful AI bring them to life—then hatch them into monsters with unique stats, skills, and traits based on your artistic style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're sketching a fearsome beast or a cute little blob, <strong>every line matters</strong>. Each drawing becomes a one-of-a-kind monster that reflects your creativity—and evolves alongside your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Draw to Create, Hatch to Battle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game tools to <strong>draw your own monster designs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI transforms your drawing into a <strong>fully animated monster</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your drawing directly influences <strong>attributes, typing, and skills</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch your monster from an egg and start your evolutionary journey</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Strategic Turn-Based Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a <strong>custom team</strong> of monsters to explore rogue-style maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master turn-based battles with <strong>synergy-driven skills</strong> and counters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat other teams, earn resources, and <strong>mutate your monsters</strong> for the next run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a chance to learn, adapt, and get stronger</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌐 Train, Trade, and Compete</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade monsters and eggs</strong> with other players in an open marketplace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare traits, exclusive skills, and secret evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the global leaderboard to prove you're the <strong>#1 monster trainer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join seasonal events, tournaments, and <strong>community challenges</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 Infinite Evolution Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two monsters are ever the same. Your choices, your drawings, your battles—everything you do reshapes your team. Become the ultimate trainer in a world where <strong>art meets AI</strong>, and strategy meets infinite possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to turn your imagination into unstoppable monsters?</strong><br>Hatch your first creation in <strong>Evolve Monster Infinite</strong>—and evolve your legacy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "《Evolve Monster Infinite》是一款融合回合制策略与Roguelike元素的怪兽养成游戏，在这里，你的想象力将成为最强武器！通过绘画创建你的怪兽，游戏内置的